{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fishing_net","model_identifier":"fishing_net","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## fishing_net\n\nWorker tool, bundled pose.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.2..3.2, y -11.0..3.0, z -3.8..3.8 (size 6.5 x 14.0 x 7.5 u = 18 x 39 x 21 cm).\nFishing net, bundled: a folded net gathered at the top by the hand line and hanging below the fist (lead weights round the rim). Origin = the gathered grip at slot_hand_r; the bundle hangs 2-11 u below. Two-handed carry: the left hand holds the bundle 6 u below the grip. The thrown, open net is `fishing_net_open.bbmodel`.\n"},"description":"## fishing_net\n\nWorker tool, bundled pose.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.2..3.2, y -11.0..3.0, z -3.8..3.8 (size 6.5 x 14.0 x 7.5 u = 18 x 39 x 21 cm).\nFishing net, bundled: a folded net gathered at the top by the hand line and hanging below the fist (lead weights round the rim). Origin = the gathered grip at slot_hand_r; the bundle hangs 2-11 u below. Two-handed carry: the left hand holds the bundle 6 u below the grip. The thrown, open net is `fishing_net_open.bbmodel`.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"gather","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-2.0,-0.75],"to":[0.75,1.0,0.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[5,15,6.5,18.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[7,15,8.5,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[9,15,10.5,18.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,15,12.5,18.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[5,21,6.5,22.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,21,8.5,22.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b437b885-6d04-5ebb-8859-084d5fa8687f"},{"name":"bun